      "content": "looks like the connection cut off there for a second. can u finish that last one and just give me the rest of the 10 reviews? \n\nalso, just a quick check—the first few look great, but i'm seeing some very high scores on the test run for those. if they look too \"perfectly positive\" i won't be able to tell if the engine is actually picking up nuanced sentiment or just spamming. try to keep them sounding like stuff people actually post on TripAdvisor, even if the score is high.",
